; ted-readline-tab-column-tokens (#377): readline expanded a TAB from the
; number of bytes stored so far, a token counting 2 instead of the length
; of its name.  A tokenised file, line 2: NPrint (token $DD82), TAB, "a";
; tab size 8 (@opts); SAVE.  Correct: NPrint, 2 blanks, "a" (a at column 9);
; the original expands the TAB from column 2: NPrint, 6 blanks, "a".
; @fixed #377
; @file bo.bb2 "x\x00\xdd\x82\ta\x00"
; @source F bo.bb2
; @opts tabstop=8
; @expect data bo.bb2 "x\x00\xdd\x82  a\x00"
timeout 10
wait req "OKEE DOKEE"
gad 1
wait screen
dump loaded
menu 0 2
wait freq "Name to save file as"
freq ok
wait screen
menu 0 9
wait exit
